{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_nblade_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_nblade_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "授刀",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_nblade_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9006c05548cd6811175dcfc20ae5c107226fa901d9e7b7a4193c663774fd0b0e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "前辈......夜刀前辈好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等等。你，等一下，你认识我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是、是的。我研究过A4行动组的作战案例......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦，你叫什么名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我叫曼迪，前辈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "以前没见过你......才入职不久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是的！我是三月过来的，通过了外勤干员的考核，目前正在学习近卫干员的课程中！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "近卫......你会用刀吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "学过一点，您问这个——\n啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "接着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这把刀......是您随身的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "拿着，就用它和我打一场，看看你的实力如何。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呜哇？！这——怎么能？我还完全达不到和您交手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不必妄自菲薄，你发挥全部实力就好，我自有判断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夜刀，等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "巡林者老爷子，既然你在，就帮我看着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夜刀，别逗小孩子玩了，他们一会儿还要去上课呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好吧......抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没关系。那两位前辈，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好啦好啦，你忙你的去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我说夜刀，这几天老看你在找那些新人。你那身手就放过年轻人啦，他们还不够你两下子的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是吗？我记得我刚来罗德岛的时候，没有那么弱......至少和前辈交手两下不在话下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那都是很久之前了，那会也没这么多人，都是进来就工作的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "时代变了，现在流行的是培养新人，夯实他们的基础，然后是怎么说来着......哦对，帮助他们融入职场环境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他们还有两人三足滑冰赛玩，真令老夫羡慕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "原来如此，我不是很清楚现在的情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这也没什么要特别了解的。汽水，夜刀要来一罐吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（接住）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但话又说回来，这些年轻人能通过干员考核，肯定也是不简单的，和咱们不过就是差些实战经验，很快就能赶上来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "前辈，年轻人中有战斗技巧比较出色的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "战斗......这方面老夫没有去了解过，可以帮你去问问。怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你知道，我的刀坏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦，老夫想起来了，是在砍磐蟹那时候吧，你还找黑角要了备用刀来着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再去后勤部领一把，或者找火神小姐定制一把新武器，她肯定乐意帮忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "难不成夜刀是想收徒，把旧刀当作信物传下去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老夫说着玩的，哈哈哈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈、哈......不会吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我原有这样的打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是，夜刀......这没意义啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道......我既不是教官，也不懂如何教导他们。何况我也不知道他们是不是需要这把刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "算了，没事。我自己再思索一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夜刀......很少见到她这样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这把刀......考虑到它的服役时间和维修次数，修复到能够使用的程度是不可能了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "申请设备报废后有两个选择：向后勤部申请制式佩刀，或者有特殊需要找我定制。都是上系统填个表就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不过看起来这把刀对你有特殊的意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是我来到罗德岛后拿到的第一把刀，我在东国时佩刀的碎片被熔铸进其中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "被重熔过......原来如此，难怪这把刀在强度上有所不足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再之前，碎开的那把刀是我以前的剑术师傅留下的，交到了我手上。刀就是这样被留下来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "说来奇怪，我已经离开故地很久了，但现在再端详这把刀时却想起了这段历史，直到现在......才想要将它留下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "的确不是个好时机，所以你会很纠结要怎么处置这把武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好吧，我尊重你的习惯，但是我还是得说，一时半会儿你很难了结心愿，收徒赠刀并不是简单的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "更何况它是一把用不了的刀，想不到罗德岛上有谁会想要它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "说实话，我以前没想过会有这么一天。我原以为它会坚持得比我更久，最差的结局也是在战场上折断......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你说得对......我是不是该趁早打消这个念头......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔，如果你还想继续使用它的话，我还有一个办法，不过也是老法子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "将这把刀继续熔铸成新刀，不过这么一来，刀体的强度又会再次下降，会更加容易损坏。我不会建议你在高强度的战斗中使用它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要怎么做，你自己做决定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "明白了......我需要再考虑一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "又分心了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你......夜刀，你怎么竟被一把刀挑得心神不宁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "打扰了，夜刀前辈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我叫席琳，席琳·弗里曼。正在外勤部实习，目标是成为一名能担当先锋职责的干员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "找我有什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（深呼吸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "抱歉，我无意间听到了您和巡林者前辈的对话，您正在寻找交战的对象。我想......我想与您交手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你想和我打一场？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，没错......我想要赢得向您学习的资格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "席琳她......竟然去找夜刀前辈了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她不会这么快就忘记找上炎客前辈的后果了吧？自从剑术课的测试失误了以后，她就一直在胡来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她都快要把“证明自己”写在脸上了，真是不服输的性子。听说夜刀前辈一向直来直往，应该不会答应她的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我会注意招式的分寸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没必要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那好......得罪了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（躲、躲开了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "后面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（速度很快，但我能跟得上......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呵哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你看清了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没......没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夜刀前辈的刀......是什么时候架在席琳脖子上的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你输了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "前辈，我......我想再试一次！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（刚才那招不行，这招或许......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔......你又输了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（怎么会？我明明躲开了她的招式，她应该击空了才对！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（这把刀......又出现在了这里......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "差不多够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，等等......夜刀前辈，请让我再试一次！最后一次！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你不是我的对手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......这一次我不会输的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（我知道她的战斗方式，就用上次炎客前辈的那招拼一下，一定可以......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......又失败了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "差距......好大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "连刀都被击飞了，夜刀前辈果然不留情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "刀脱手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你......再跟着教官勤加练习吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜林",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呼......呼噜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我输了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "照场上的局势来看，获胜者是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......是俺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "连赢三轮牌，你今天手气倒是不坏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "黑角，你出来是不是换了新面具？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "对，之前那个面具在作战中不是坏了嘛，就送去修了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎，不是！俺不是为了换手气才特地换了新面具！俺才不会干那种事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "行了行了。老规矩，谁输了谁来请客，到我了。大家要喝什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "干马地尼，老样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "杜林......算了，给她来杯鲜榨果汁吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那俺也要鲜榨......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一份干马地尼，一份鲜榨果汁，两份生命之水兑香草沙士，谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "黑角，被磐蟹追着的时候你不是还叫着“再也受不了这些仙人掌汁了，临死前一定要再喝一杯生命之水兑香草沙士”，怎么——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在说什么？生命之水兑香草沙士吗？我给你点了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜林",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呼......奇怪，夜刀也喝酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夜刀，还在为那把刀的事烦心吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "还行吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "俺听说，你今天在训练室和一位年轻人交手了，她怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一般。底子是有，但是进攻太急躁，经验也不足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗐，老夫才走了一会儿，夜刀又打起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "回来后老夫问了下，那名年轻人叫做......呃......席琳，应该是这个名字，已经算是年轻人中不错的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要是她进不了夜刀的眼，其他的也就不行了。要承下夜刀的刀，不容易啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦，是席琳啊。俺知道她。模拟训练的时候带过她一两回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你觉得她怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就跟你说的差不多，太急了。她训练的确是很刻苦，脑子也灵光，但是实战发挥的时候老是失常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她性格既内向，又很不服输，不善于请教别人，总是自己一根筋扎进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她有一点挺特别的，在和我交手的时候有一招用得很像炎客那家伙的把式。后来听到有些人说她也和炎客交手过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是啊，她是个优点和缺点都很明显的年轻人，教官都和她说过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉，她自己都明白，不过越是遭遇挫折她就越是受打击，这让她更着急，反而止步不前了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真遗憾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夜刀，你是不是觉得她和以前的你有点像啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，一点儿都不像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老夫插句嘴啊，有件事老夫一直很好奇，夜刀，除了收徒传刀是你们那边的传统以外，还有什么其他原因让你想这么做吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "其他原因？为什么这么问？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，别怪老夫瞎说，但是我们现在都是雇员，年轻人也算是同事，有专业团队培养，我们真的没有特别的必要去做这种事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "火神也和我说了相似的话，我想了想，的确没有什么，甚至我宁愿他们不需要我这把刀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "早上我还做了一件事，我去人事部询问了扩充人手的事宜，得到的回复是目前新人的能力尚未达到进入行动预备组的标准。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "之前咱们商量的加人的事没有结果，估计有段时日，工作还得由我们这些人全盘扛住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这么长时间都是这么过来的，老夫不会有什么怨言，大家也是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道，但......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "黑角，这次任务回来医生给你缝了几针？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "五......不对，六......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老爷子，你肩上的旧伤都复发三次了，以为我不知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "杜林的睡袋也丢了好几个。尽管任务的难度越来越大，我确定我们还能撑下去，只是不知道能撑到哪一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我是这么想这把刀的，能找到个适合的苗子帮到我们的工作，也不完全算是浪费时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "退一万步讲，如果哪天我们不在这里了，至少这把刀还能留下来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夜刀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂喂，任务都完成了，好不容易聚一次，大家愁眉苦脸的做什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "酒来了，喝，一起喝一杯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "来来，喝一杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "干杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那个......抱歉打扰各位前辈的兴致了，我想找夜刀前辈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是......早上的实习干员......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "曼迪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊对，是你，我想起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "害怕什么呀，直说就好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是这样的！早上我见到了您和席琳的交手！我......虽然我现在的战斗技巧还远远不足，但是我非常想要向您学习。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "学习？向我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是的！我对您的战斗方式非常向往......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "抱歉，实话实说，能不能教人这事，我自己还没想明白，这方面我没有经验。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸，俺突然有个法子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夜刀，要不明天你跟俺一起去做模拟训练好了！俺们可以打一架，展示给年轻人看！这方面俺可熟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "模拟训练。你是指......我们在他们面前作战？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是啊，俺做过好多次了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以经常找不到你人，就是做这个去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，嘿嘿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊......如果能这样的话，实在是太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老夫觉得这是个好主意，你也可以体验一下教人的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么样？夜刀，考虑一下嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......好吧，那就试试。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘘，不要说话，黑角前辈正在讲话呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "曼迪！快来这边！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "来啦来啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳咳......有人没有听见，那我就再说一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "今天模拟训练的特别嘉宾，是俺的组长，夜刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "接下来，俺会和夜刀交手，向你们演示一下A4行动组的战斗方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那么，夜刀，俺们来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "黑角大哥要和夜刀前辈......我还以为他们只是表演一下而已，他们竟然要来真的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "黑角大哥，真的顶得住吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈，哈，俺要上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（黑角大哥用上全力了。如果是我的话，会尝试躲开这一刀，可夜刀前辈......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（低声）是要放慢动作，让他们都能看清吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（低声）还要专心，可不要小看俺哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（硬碰硬挡下来了...... 难道这么做的用意是挡住敌方的刀路？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（他们又拉开距离了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈，这次我可要认真起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "吃我这一击！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（夜刀前辈的战斗方式很有章法，我应该能预测到......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎呀，俺输了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（最后一招，夜刀前辈闪开了黑角大哥的攻势，仅凭脚步的挪移，来到了敌人的侧面。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（上一次和我战斗时，夜刀前辈同样一瞬间出现在我身后，很可能也是以这种方式......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是一次简单的遭遇战对抗，大家都看清楚了吧？没看清的各位，终端里有回放哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好了，接下来的模拟训练就由俺来做你们的对手......夜刀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "今天的剩余时间，由我来做各位的对手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等下，夜刀——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这么做有问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "倒不是有问题，但是模拟训练是有个规矩的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "奖励。俺们模拟训练都是有奖励的，要是打赢了你，有什么奖励吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......一招即可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只要有谁能赢了我一招，我会把全部战斗经验，毫无保留地教给他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我！夜刀前辈，我来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "数小时后"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉，我没能撑过两招。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你还叹什么气？看看别人，在夜刀前辈手下能撑过两招已经够不错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我都挑战三次了。看了很多遍录像，还是没有搞明白夜刀前辈的战斗方式......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "还有吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "席琳呢？她竟然没有去试一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没有的话，今天就到这里结束吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夜刀前辈，我想试试。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（抛出刀）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "上来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（夜刀前辈还是一样的动作，毫无破绽，看不出她会从哪里出手。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（先做好准备......等她出手。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "让我先来，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（勉、勉强架住了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（把注意力放在刀上，正面对抗......这种方法果然有效。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（她，她是在和我说话？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我要继续了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（躲开了......但是有机会！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（被闪开了，她的速度太惊人了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "席琳和夜刀前辈交手三招了？你没骗我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "甚至还击了一次......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘘，别吵。注意看，席琳的闪躲动作和夜刀前辈方才的动作有点相似。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她不仅是在适应夜刀前辈的战斗节奏，她真的学到了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "慢下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（她在......提醒我？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（好，这几次攻击都挡下来了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（大概适应她的进攻节奏了，我一定可以......成功完成反击。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（试试看，用夜刀前辈的那种动作。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（闪开了，然后像她那样，最直接地出刀——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "席琳她......击中夜刀前辈了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不是吧？！席琳！你真的做到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我！我做到了吗？我的确击中了什么，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你输了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "飘下来的......这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一片布？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "关注刀还是关注对手，是要因战况而改变的。你仍是着急了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不过，你学到了。我很开心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......不......我没能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真棒！席琳！你已经做得很好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "席琳，你太厉害了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（能在这么短的时间内做到这样，实在难得，席琳......她或许足够拿起......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真厉害啊，这下不得不朝着席琳努力了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是啊，希望还能继续和夜刀前辈交手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "想递出刀的手停在刀柄上，夜刀环视场下的干员们。\n她看见，一双双年轻的眼睛，目光紧紧地落在自己身上。\n她突然意识到，在他们眼中留下的正是自己的身影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夜刀前辈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "还有事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......我虽然输了，但......还有机会再和您交手吗？我从和您的战斗中，真的学到了很多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我也是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "实习干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们也想继续和夜刀前辈交手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "听好了，明天我还会来这里，和大家模拟训练。黑角，应该没问题吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不就是填表申请嘛，包在俺身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "以及，我会带来一把刀，放在训练室中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "既然今天无人赢下我，我就做出这个决定......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "今后，只要我出现在这里，所有人都可以拿起这把刀与我战斗，我时刻乐意奉陪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "罗德岛的新人们，我期待下次见到你们的身影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以，你和年轻人们打了几场，然后就决定把这把刀熔掉了，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可以这么说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是想好把刀送给哪位看上的年轻人吗？不对......那样你根本就没有必要熔铸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，因为这把刀仍会参与战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那我去烧炉子了，你要记住我的提醒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“不要在高强度的战斗中使用”，我当然记得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "从此以后，它会被留下来，只会参与一场战斗，被不同的手挥动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "直到遥远的将来，直到......也许我们都不在的日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她注视着那把刀在如骄阳般红艳的锻炉中，缓缓下沉，逐渐熔化。\n最终，刀的形体已不复存在，只剩下一团灼红的液体。\n犹如新血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
